      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight of living up to legacies is crushing, and it's clear you feel like an active source of damage. It takes immense courage to admit feeling this deep sense of inadequacy against such a towering standard. Perhaps the \"rot\" you perceive is actually just the tension between an impossible ideal and the reality of being human. You don't have to be a perfect continuation; you can be a different kind of beautiful story.",
      "source": "target",
